\\}$ and suppose\n\n$$\nf(-4)=5,\\,f(1)=-2,\\,f(3)=5,\\,f(7)=3.\n$$\n\nCompute ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x).$\n\n$\\,$\n${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nThe outputs are $5,$ $-2,$ $5,$ and $3,$ so the maximum output value is $5.$ This maximum occurs at both $x=-4$ and $x=3.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=5\\,\\text{and}\\,\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=\\{-4,3\\}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534059 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231450 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4f56e312-a8c4-5c65-9893-3ebc38120b4d" :knowledge-point/title "Distinguishing Between Max/Min and Argmax/Argmin"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "86cb2282-41ef-59cc-908f-418ef2e3edae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533457}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "86cb2282-41ef-59cc-908f-418ef2e3edae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533457} :answer-field/id #uuid "6da1e1f1-107c-5dd2-8cef-c1812fbbbc7f" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533868} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14f2b348-b686-5c07-86c7-7171577ae800" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533188}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "14f2b348-b686-5c07-86c7-7171577ae800" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533188} :answer