n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nHere, the outputs are $5,$ $-12,$ $11,$ and $1.$ \n\n- The largest output is $11,$ and it occurs at $x=0.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-12,$ and it occurs at $x=-3.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =11 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =0 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-12 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534076 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231450 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4f56e312-a8c4-5c65-9893-3ebc38120b4d" :knowledge-point/title "Distinguishing Between Max/Min and Argmax/Argmin"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a7788327-b0c0-54fc-85c0-8f6bfa719642" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533545}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a7788327-b0c0-54fc-85c0-8f6bfa719642" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533545} :answer-field/id #uuid "8a466fba-def7-55ba-8f8f-e4d5b58d8d7b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533884} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "73cb411d-4a6d-5b99-97f0-3be8b1af87bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533414}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "73cb411d-4a6d-5b99-97f0-3be8b1af87bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :a