eld-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nHere, the outputs are $-8,$ $1,$ $3,$ and $10.$ \n\n- The largest output is $10,$ and it occurs at $x=2.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-8,$ and it occurs at $x=4.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =10 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =2 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-8 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534058 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231450 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4f56e312-a8c4-5c65-9893-3ebc38120b4d" :knowledge-point/title "Distinguishing Between Max/Min and Argmax/Argmin"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2386d57b-ed50-53d0-80cf-499c5d294b01" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533227}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2386d57b-ed50-53d0-80cf-499c5d294b01" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533227} :answer-field/id #uuid "00f24f4e-6b01-5041-96f3-1e504afd4cc9" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533770} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b91d0da4-4e21-54ff-b39f-e67a4d4817f7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533591}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b91d0da4-4e21-54ff-b39f-e67a4d4817f7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1