$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nHere, the outputs are $-11,$ $-5,$ $2,$ and $12.$ \n\n- The largest output is $12,$ and it occurs at $x=0.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-11,$ and it occurs at $x=3.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =12 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =0 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-11 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534061 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231451 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "258ff70f-5f41-5ea6-a0c2-bf74e7ce1cff" :knowledge-point/title "Computing Argmax and Argmin With Ties"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4cdd2359-4f08-5de2-b8c6-339e496e96cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{-1,2\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533323} {:answer/id #uuid "5b53cc0e-b8d0-57bc-a8bf-28eabda8c6e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{-3,4\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533348} {:answer/id #uuid "6415206d-18ea-53ee-88e7-71c6faf3f06a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{-3\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533370} {:answer/id #uuid "ed534d52-3854-58bb-9eb5-cfbec36ecf1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{2\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533723} {:answer/id #uuid "faab9734-8e3b-5ebb-80e9-1cf7d08c55d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answe