{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x).$\n\n$\\,$\n${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $5,$ $1,$ $1,$ and $8,$ so the minimum output value is $1.$ This minimum occurs at both $x=-1$ and $x=2.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=1\\,\\text{and}\\,\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=\\{-1,2\\}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534007 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231451 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "258ff70f-5f41-5ea6-a0c2-bf74e7ce1cff" :knowledge-point/title "Computing Argmax and Argmin With Ties"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16c83e94-ae98-529d-89d6-030b4ba65c27" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533190} {:answer/id #uuid "32728266-17ee-5834-98d0-7081fcf6278e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533262} {:answer/id #uuid "a057dbd2-121a-5b50-83ed-e137b18aa10c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533529} {:answer/id #uuid "fec2c26d-c48d-58d2-b10d-e3f202e6f4c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533765}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "32728266-17ee-5834-98d0-7081fcf6278e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533262} :answer-field/id #uuid "98216f74-dc70-5d6d-8b65-3533eb892def" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533