name{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in B}k(x)$ is an input in $B$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $-5,$ $-8,$ $-2,$ and $-8,$ so the minimum output value is $-8.$ This minimum occurs at both $x=-2$ and $x=3.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{min}_{x\\in B}k(x)=-8\\,\\text{and}\\,\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in B}k(x)=\\{-2,3\\}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534087 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231452 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "24771a14-af10-5bc8-94d4-17c28b180c84" :knowledge-point/title "Writing and Reading Formal Notation"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "031d6483-a285-51fe-8ffd-764744e050a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The value of $x$ in $[-1,1]$ where $h(x)$ is largest." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533138} {:answer/id #uuid "21d18115-9663-5052-9c07-22d8d804669d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The smallest value of $h(x)$ on $[-1,1].$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533217} {:answer/id #uuid "4bae1a6b-5b4f-5d7e-bafc-72b4dd45bce6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The largest value of $h(x)$ on $[-1,1].$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533319} {:answer/id #uuid "80db74a6-c35f-567d-a346-735228c01219" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The value of $x$ in $[-1,1]$ where $h(x)$ is smallest." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533446} {:answer/id #uuid "d0ab9aff-a3e4-57ed-9978-6a8fc88bbe0c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The average value of $h(x)$ on $[-1,1].$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533648}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "80db74a6-c35f-567d-a346-735228c01219" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The value of $x$ in $[-1,1]$ where $h(x)$ is smallest." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533446} :answer